    "title": "Marilyn Jean Clark - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ocala-News.com Obituaries ,\n1 days ago Marilyn Jean Clark (Lamarre), 79, passed away in Ocala, Florida on September 11, 2026. Marilyn was born in Pawtucket, Rhode Island, to Raymond and Mary (Reid) Lamarre. She attended St. Teresa School and graduated from Tolman High School. Marilyn was a sister to Janice Tetreault (Paul), William Lamarre (Janet), Diane... Read full article",
